stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> MODE_STOP : Boot

    MODE_STOP --> MODE_DRIVE : CMD,...,DRIVE
    MODE_STOP --> MODE_PARK : CMD,...,PARK
    MODE_STOP --> MODE_FINISH : CMD,...,FINISH
    MODE_STOP --> MODE_FAULT : Timeout / Invalid

    MODE_DRIVE --> MODE_DRIVE : CMD,...,DRIVE
    MODE_DRIVE --> MODE_PARK : CMD,...,PARK
    MODE_DRIVE --> MODE_FINISH : CMD,...,FINISH
    MODE_DRIVE --> MODE_FAULT : Timeout / Invalid

    MODE_PARK --> MODE_PARK : CMD,...,PARK
    MODE_PARK --> MODE_FINISH : CMD,...,FINISH
    MODE_PARK --> MODE_FAULT : Timeout / Invalid

    MODE_FINISH --> MODE_STOP : STOP
    MODE_FINISH --> MODE_FAULT : Timeout / Invalid

    MODE_FAULT --> MODE_STOP : STOP / PING

    note right of MODE_FAULT
        Motor stop + centred steering
        Entered on serial timeout (>350ms)
        or invalid command
    end note
